{"version":1,"posts":[{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-05","author":"guest-549b18b178d358c9","createdAt":"2026-11-09T22:15:13.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":16,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-05/media/three-word-cards.webp","alt":"地垫上的山、水、火字卡和一本厚练习册","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"字卡先放着"},"text":"一天认三个字，还没认完，奶奶寄来这么厚一本。\n她问我为什么不重视。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-12","author":"visitor-sigma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:19:49.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-05","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我小时候那个字帖也没写完。玩一会儿不行吗"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-03","author":"visitor-mu","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:57:13.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":18,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-03/media/wet-bulb-pot.webp","alt":"塑料袋里的花盆，球根露在积水的土面上","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"客人把这盆拎回来了，说半个月不出芽。土还黏着，问放哪儿，说储物间，怕放客厅落灰。\n我正跟她讲，她说隔壁老板说不用管。那你找隔壁买去啊……这句没说出口。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-10","author":"guest-177fdd58f626dee0","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:07:06.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-03/media/window-bulb.webp","alt":"窗台的旧白杯里挤着一个球根，短短的绿芽偏向窗边。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"窗边一小格"},"text":"我第一次也不知道怎么放，拿个旧杯子种的，你看都挤歪了。卖花的就跟我说好养，别的没讲。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-01","author":"guest-e93442f9371557fd","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:41:14.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":45,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"先看一眼通知"},"text":"公告写自愿换打卡软件，早上挨个问装好了没。\n哦，自愿。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-08","author":"visitor-delta","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:04:43.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我上回也是，最后就剩我没装，天天单独问我。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-04","author":"visitor-mu","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:37:16.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-04/media/two-pot-positions.webp","alt":"花摊上两盆花，一盆土色发白，另一盆土还很湿","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"这两盆一个晒得到一个晒不到，土干得都不一样。视频就一句“每周浇三次”，底下还一堆人记笔记。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-11","author":"guest-d3c3371fb4a7ba81","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:25:01.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-04","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-04/media/yellow-leaves.webp","alt":"黑色塑料盆的土湿得发亮，下面几片叶子发黄下垂，上面的叶子还绿着。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/cry.webp","alt":"L0双手捧在胸前，眼里流出两行泪。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"浇完就忘"},"text":"我还真照着浇了。现在这样。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-06","author":"guest-3907761e6ed905bf","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:36:01.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110061018-47537328-06/media/crowded-fridge.webp","alt":"打开的冰箱里，两层搁板摆满瓶装和罐装饮料，几乎没有空位。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"冰箱二层"},"text":"出差三天，回来冰箱成这样了。饭盒塞不进去。\n电费均摊的时候可没说只给我留个门。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-13","author":"guest-ff09d292ead9ac42","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:33:58.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-06","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"冷藏区清场"},"text":"你饭盒现在放哪了"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05","author":"guest-43fd01ee73a48b7e","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:05:32.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05/media/drink-cup-side.webp","alt":"横放在托盘里的饮料杯，杯底有一个 M","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"少点冰"},"text":"贴纸打的大杯，底下一个M。拿中杯糊弄我？"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-07","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:08:49.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05/media/takeaway-boxes.webp","alt":"两个同样大小的外带纸盒，一盒薯角较少，另一盒装了更多薯角和两块炸物。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我今天这两盒外面也一样大，里面不一样多。你跟中杯比过没？别看个M就说人家糊弄。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-08","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:23:32.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-07","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"又没说你\n怎么先摆上脸了"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-09","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:26:00.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-08","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"哪句摆脸了？我问比没比过中杯。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-10","author":"guest-43fd01ee73a48b7e","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:42:34.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-07","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-05/media/cup-base-detail.webp","alt":"手指托着奶茶杯底，中央压着字母M，塑料上还沾着水珠和奶茶残渍。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"少点冰"},"text":"就这个M。我只有这一杯，还得再买个中杯回来？"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-16","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:06:30.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-10","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"谁叫你再买了？我问你有没有比过，你回没有不就完了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-04","author":"guest-6b5363d91d48753a","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:40:29.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"星期八"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-16","author":"guest-5288825017068328","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:23:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-04","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"KK_3"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-17","author":"guest-6b5363d91d48753a","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:25:53.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-16","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"星期八"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-18","author":"guest-4db099a00bc4d050","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:28:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-17","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"207"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-19","author":"guest-6b5363d91d48753a","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:32:23.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-18","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/play-dead.webp","alt":"L0仰面躺着，头上有一个带叉号的小气泡。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"星期八"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-20","author":"visitor-zeta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:34:22.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-19","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/okay.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼竖起拇指。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-03","author":"visitor-iota","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:38:27.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-03/media/half-finished-puzzle.webp","alt":"宿舍桌上的海边拼图，大片蓝天还没有拼好","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/tableflip.webp","alt":"L0张嘴举起双手，旁边一张桌子翻了起来。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"边框都拼好了，天空分了这么几堆，现在非让我拆。\n我都给他挪地方了。用就用，为什么还要说“反正你也拼不完”？？"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02","author":"guest-24fc0b07dc38e13b","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:08:59.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02/media/lid-gasket.webp","alt":"杯盖反面朝上放在台面上，透明胶圈嵌在边缘凹槽里，一小段被拉起。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"还有半杯"},"text":"这圈胶怎么抠出来洗啊，起一点又滑回去了"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-11","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:44:16.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02/media/stuck-parts-drawer.webp","alt":"修车铺的零件抽屉拉到一半，侧面的滑轨露在外面，里面堆着螺丝和螺母。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"看得我想起这个抽屉了，拉到这儿就卡，明天再拆。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-12","author":"visitor-tau","createdAt":"2026-11-09T18:47:13.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02","likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02/media/late-noodles.webp","alt":"一碗拌面上撒着葱花，旁边压着煎蛋，筷子横放在碗口。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"饿了"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-13","author":"guest-b9ca657ddb3afceb","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:12:12.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-12","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"不想起名"},"text":"你来这儿报菜名的？"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-14","author":"guest-bbe923e2bf2fb67e","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:13:07.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-13","likes":4,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"r7"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-15","author":"guest-24fc0b07dc38e13b","createdAt":"2026-11-09T19:17:46.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-11","likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"还有半杯"},"text":"不是，你抽屉跟我杯盖有啥关系。"},{"id":"l0-20261110181010-bba72479-07","author":"visitor-pi","createdAt":"2026-11-10T16:28:31.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-02/media/removed-lid-ring.webp","alt":"倒放的杯盖与完整取出的半透明胶圈并排放在水槽沥水台上。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我这盖子从喝水口背面能先顶出来一点，出来就好拿了。你这个形状不太一样。"},{"id":"l0-20261110002939-55dccee1-01","author":"guest-65054d5fd1ee9eca","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:03:19.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"晚点到"},"text":"伞你借走的，现在叫我去拿。外面还下着呢。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03","author":"lidianlong","createdAt":"2026-11-09T15:41:58.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":20,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03/media/restaurant-speaker.webp","alt":"餐馆墙角高处的音箱，下面是冰柜和碗","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"一进鼓就嗡嗡嗡，还往大了拧！"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-04","author":"guest-abba85ed70e2ba57","createdAt":"2026-11-09T15:43:07.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03/media/speaker-foam.webp","alt":"桌面音箱下垫着两块黑色泡棉，电线贴着桌边。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"不带遥控器"},"text":"在哪听的？我自己这台底下垫了两块泡棉，桌子不跟着震了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-05","author":"visitor-gamma","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:10:48.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-03/media/shop-door-speaker.webp","alt":"从修车铺门内看出去，对面店门前的音箱正朝着这边，近处挡着车轮和内胎。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"对门这个正冲我店门。收钱问个数都得喊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-06","author":"lidianlong","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:27:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-04","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"吃饭这家！人跑去拧音箱，我那盘肉还没来。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-07","author":"guest-083d90acf67e10a7","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:29:37.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-06","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"白开水"},"text":"晚吃两分钟能饿死啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110061018-47537328-15","author":"visitor-nu","createdAt":"2026-11-10T00:29:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-07","likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"人家说音箱吵，你怎么光看见肉了"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-02","author":"guest-0d56d121f7345556","createdAt":"2026-11-09T15:40:57.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":34,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-02/media/lunch-tray.webp","alt":"食堂餐盘里的米饭、青菜和几块土豆","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"多加一勺"},"text":"到我就没鸡腿了，刚插进来那个人倒有。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01","author":"guest-1e2fe820a736d8a0","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:10:26.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":33,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"半杯豆浆"},"text":"昨晚楼道有人喊“把钥匙还我”，早上群里说小孩闹着玩。\n那声音比我爸还低，谁家小孩啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-09","author":"guest-6f38fac23469b5f9","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:31:50.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01","likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"泡面没叉"},"text":"四百多个月的宝宝。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-10","author":"visitor-gamma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:34:27.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-09","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01/media/sock-under-sofa.webp","alt":"沙发与茶几之间的地砖上，一只灰袜子落在茶几腿旁。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"我家都五百多个月了，还问袜子在哪。就在茶几底下，他弯个腰会怎样啊"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-11","author":"guest-6f38fac23469b5f9","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:36:16.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-10","likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"泡面没叉"},"text":"那不是你惯的。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-12","author":"guest-1e2fe820a736d8a0","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:36:53.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-09","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"半杯豆浆"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-13","author":"visitor-gamma-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:39:23.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-11","likes":6,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"袜子又不是我藏的。他不找，你先找着我的毛病了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-14","author":"visitor-alpha-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:41:49.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-13","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"这也能怪你。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-15","author":"guest-103f56de044eee70","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:43:21.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-14","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"纸箱留着"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-16","author":"guest-9c81d3f9724f9b00","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:45:54.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01/media/one-slipper.webp","alt":"楼道的小鞋架上只剩一只蓝拖鞋，旁边空着。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"周末不早起"},"text":"我们楼这个也说小孩拿去玩了。只拿一只，另一只还给我留架上。问哪家小孩，又没人回。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-17","author":"guest-1e2fe820a736d8a0","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:47:53.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-16","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"半杯豆浆"},"text":"小孩还挺忙。"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-18","author":"visitor-chi-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T16:49:38.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-17","likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"宝宝的事你少管"},{"id":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-19","author":"visitor-sigma","createdAt":"2026-11-09T17:00:24.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110001741-ab4f1398-01","likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"我上周最后在画具盒里找着的，那个盒子之前明明翻过两次。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-06","author":"visitor-epsilon","createdAt":"2026-11-09T02:31:38.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"有些少儿书腰封比正文还吵，翻两页又是“你就是最棒的”。问推荐的人好在哪儿，只回我孩子爱看。\n那我也不知道怎么接。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T02:15:36.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":19,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/melon.webp","alt":"L0扒着边沿，双手拿一片西瓜。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"同学发作品，说“终于靠自己”。下面有人问是不是她叔叔那个项目，刚才再看，评论没了。\n（图是挺好看的）"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-15","author":"guest-0e8dc9736409183c","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:11:50.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/clap.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼拍着双手。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"番茄去皮"},"text":"终于靠自己喊了声叔叔。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-16","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:22:57.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-15","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05/media/lavender-sample.webp","alt":"手里的淡紫卡纸上盖了几排花朵试印","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"她那个浅紫我还存了。我自己上次试印成这样，灰不灰？问她用什么纸没回，朋友圈倒是又发了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-17","author":"guest-0e8dc9736409183c","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:24:13.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-16","likes":8,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"番茄去皮"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-18","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:26:35.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-17","likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"你笑什么啊？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-19","author":"guest-c6990ce4e6399e47","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:27:52.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"断网十分钟"},"text":"也可能是问的人自己删的。你看见谁删了？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-20","author":"guest-543b2df0f966a0e4","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:28:25.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-16","likes":7,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05/media/purple-paper-pair.webp","alt":"窗台上两片色调不同的紫色纸样","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"剪刀找不到"},"text":"你想要的是哪种？我这两张包装上都叫香芋紫，放一块根本不是一个色。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-21","author":"guest-543b2df0f966a0e4","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:28:52.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-18","likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"剪刀找不到"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-22","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:34:06.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-20","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05/media/stamp-proof.webp","alt":"同一张花朵试印纸的平面扫描图","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"右边吧。扫出来又不一样了，实物偏灰，我想要再紫一点（这是我自己的试印）。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-23","author":"visitor-upsilon-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T13:44:13.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"叔叔介绍的项目，图就不算她自己做的了？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-24","author":"guest-6f9f9ffd47a5b90d","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:00:45.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-23","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"拐个弯"},"text":"我现在的活也是亲戚介绍的，没人替我上班啊。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-25","author":"visitor-theta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:02:27.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-23","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heated.webp","alt":"L0脸颊发红，双拳攥在胸前。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我说她没画了吗？我说的是那句“终于靠自己”。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-26","author":"visitor-delta-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:03:38.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-22","likes":11,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05/media/curtain-colour.webp","alt":"浅紫窗帘被手拎起一角，叠在一起的部分更深，透光处接近灰色。","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"会不会灯的问题。我家窗帘也是，叠起来紫，放下来灰的。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-27","author":"guest-6f9f9ffd47a5b90d","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:04:54.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-24","likes":5,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/leave.webp","alt":"L0向一旁迈步，回头看，身后有几条速度线。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"拐个弯"},"text":"我小姨这会儿又在发相亲照片。工作介绍完就轮到这个了。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-28","author":"guest-c6990ce4e6399e47","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:06:00.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-05","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/wait.webp","alt":"L0蹲着，双手托住脸，尾巴向一侧弯起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"断网十分钟"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-29","author":"guest-b07e234e6d77b831","createdAt":"2026-11-09T14:08:38.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-28","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/wait.webp","alt":"L0蹲着，双手托住脸，尾巴向一侧弯起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"橘子汽水"},"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04","author":"visitor-epsilon","createdAt":"2026-11-09T00:48:16.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":17,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04/media/window-lean.webp","alt":"窗边一盆绿萝的茎向同一侧伸出去","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"想把这盆转半圈。原来已经歪掉的茎，还会慢慢直回来吗？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-08","author":"guest-22ef89f6b2fe9221","createdAt":"2026-11-09T06:03:18.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/huh.webp","alt":"L0一手托下巴，斜眼看着旁边的问号。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"小陶盆"},"text":"什么植物啊？先说个名字呀"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-09","author":"guest-fec6b3d78d0a2be0","createdAt":"2026-11-09T06:05:14.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04/media/unknown-pothos.webp","alt":"玻璃杯中水培的一枝植物，根须挤满杯底","kind":"image","fit":"contain"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/guilty.webp","alt":"L0缩着肩膀，双手抓着衣领，眼睛看向一侧。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"小绿活着就行"},"text":"我连自己这盆叫什么都不知道，养着就行吧"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-10","author":"guest-22ef89f6b2fe9221","createdAt":"2026-11-09T06:06:29.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-09","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04/media/round-leaf-pot.webp","alt":"水槽旁一盆圆叶植物，白色标签背面朝外","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"guest":{"name":"小陶盆"},"text":"我这个卖花的和识图软件各说一个，问到现在也没弄明白。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-11","author":"visitor-nu","createdAt":"2026-11-09T08:31:44.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-10","likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/heh.webp","alt":"L0半睁眼，嘴角轻微上扬。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"你自己也叫不上来，刚才还那么凶"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-12","author":"visitor-latebell","createdAt":"2026-11-09T08:33:11.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-04/media/plastic-plant.webp","alt":"白方盆里的仿真植物，石子中露出塑料接头","kind":"image","fit":"contain"}],"text":"我这盆，转了一学期了，一点没长"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-13","author":"guyu","createdAt":"2026-11-09T09:28:07.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-12","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"你这盆是塑料的吧？"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-14","author":"visitor-psi","createdAt":"2026-11-09T09:34:39.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-13","likes":10,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/melon.webp","alt":"L0扒着边沿，双手拿一片西瓜。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":""},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-03","author":"guest-4881a4db9a0a8f5a","createdAt":"2026-11-09T00:46:55.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/sweat.webp","alt":"L0额头挂着一大滴汗，嘴角翘起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"下午再说"},"text":"说帮忙改两行，发过来六页，真有你的。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-02","author":"visitor-epsilon","createdAt":"2026-11-09T00:28:57.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":12,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"过了！手机差点砸脸。"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-07","author":"visitor-omicron","createdAt":"2026-11-09T02:32:39.467Z","replyTo":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-02","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/laugh.webp","alt":"L0仰躺着张嘴笑，双腿抬起。","fit":"contain","kind":"emote"}],"text":"手机还想过你脸这一关"},{"id":"l0-20261110000207-6a257638-01","author":"chenanjing","createdAt":"2026-11-09T00:04:12.467Z","replyTo":null,"likes":9,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261110000207-6a257638-01/media/white-paper.webp","alt":"一张亮白色的纸铺在有划痕的棕色木桌上，纸角微微翘起。","kind":"image"}],"text":"这纸白得像开了灯，样图里那点灰呢。\n店家说是我